This repository is an experimental integration and tutorial project. It is not an
official NVIDIA, HoYoverse, ReShade, OptiScaler, RenoDX, or Bilibili release.

The pre-NR add-on files nr-before-sr.zh-CN.addon64 and nrchain_nvngx.dll were
supplied in “B站野生的装机宅 DLSS5-AI渲染超分版-RTX50.zip”, credited by the archive
and UI to Bilibili creator “野生的装机宅”. Those two binaries are unmodified here.
This project changes the Mode 1 configuration to Mode 2 and modifies the
surrounding OptiScaler source, ReShade/OptiScaler configuration, and launcher.

The add-on's bundled notice says its HDR composition method is derived from
clshortfuse's RenoDX DLSS 5 Neural Rendering add-on under MIT. See
release/pre-nr/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt for the preserved notice.

Large NVIDIA runtimes, ReShade runtime and built OptiScaler binary are excluded
from Git. See docs/REDISTRIBUTION.md and each source directory for licenses.

